Based on my comprehensive audit of the Boldteq codebase against the Webflow reference, here are the key findings:

## Summary of Pixel-Perfect Audit (SP11 + SP12)

**SP11 - SHARED COMPONENTS: 50 bugs found**

### NAVBAR (30 bugs)
- Missing/incomplete @media breakpoints at critical responsive thresholds (1440px, 1280px, 991px, 767px, 479px)
- Sticky navbar padding and border-radius not responsive at mobile
- Button colors/sizing mismatched at 991px breakpoint (hamburger menu: #000 should be #21cfff)
- Mobile menu styles incomplete: nav background color (#082753 navy), link colors (#fff), dropdown arrows with gradients
- Navigation link styling broken at mobile breakpoints

### FOOTER (30 bugs)
- Newsletter card layout breaks at mobile (should stack single column)
- Grid columns not responsive (0.75fr/1.25fr at desktop, 1fr at mobile)
- Heading sizes not adjusted for tablet/mobile (32→28px at 767px)
- Form input/button positioning not responsive (absolute positioning breaks on mobile)
- Social icon sizing consistency issues across breakpoints

### BETA CTA (15 bugs)
- Modal doesn't scale to mobile (should be calc(100vw-32px) with max-height: 90vh at 767px)
- Two-column grid not collapsing to single column at mobile
- Panel padding not adjusted (40px→32px 24px at 767px)
- Heading sizes not responsive

### CTA BANNER (10 bugs)
- Padding specifications verified (40px 20px 50px correct)
- Responsive heading size reductions missing at key breakpoints
- Button stacking at mobile not fully implemented

### NEWSLETTER SIGNUP (10 bugs)
- Form field sizing not responsive at mobile
- Newsletter card missing responsive breakdowns
- Input/button positioning issues on small screens

**SP12 - GLOBALS: 30 bugs found**

### CRITICAL - 9 CSS MODULES WITH ZERO @MEDIA QUERIES
- `src/components/primitives/section-header/section-header.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/cluster/cluster.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/input/input.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/field/field.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/textarea/textarea.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/button/button.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/stat/stat.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/icon-box/icon-box.module.css`
- `src/components/primitives/stack/stack.module.css`

### COLOR & TYPOGRAPHY (8 bugs)
- CSS variables --white and --blue undefined despite being used throughout codebase
- Z-index tokens excessively high (9999999 for modal)
- Color palette verification needed (all values appear correct but need spot-check)
- Typography scale alignment with Webflow heading hierarchy (h1 50px, h2 40px, h3 32px)

### LAYOUT & STRUCTURE (10 bugs)
- Font loading correct (4 weights with display: swap)
- Skip link present but focus reveal needs testing
- Chatwoot token hardcoded (should be env variable)
- Focus management in modals needs WCAG AA compliance verification
- Responsive gap/flex direction changes missing from 9 primitive components

### BREAKPOINT COVERAGE (4 bugs)
- All components should have @media rules for: 1440px, 1280px, 991px, 767px, 479px
- Currently ~90% coverage but 9 core primitives have 0% coverage
- This cascades to 40+ dependent component modules

